" width=\"53.1\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-3)\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"537.8\" y=\"352\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Packing</text><line class=\"ref\" x1=\"585.6\" y1=\"308\" x2=\"585.6\" y2=\"344\"/><text class=\"dg-value dg-strong\" x=\"585.6\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"end\">5.1 days</text></g><g class=\"st-s\"><line class=\"ref\" x1=\"936\" y1=\"308\" x2=\"936\" y2=\"344\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"936\" y=\"358\" text-anchor=\"end\">current 8.4 d</text></g><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"44\" y=\"392\">Dark: processing time. Light: waiting. Teal: waiting at Assembly.</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"44\" y=\"412\">Segments follow the routing order above: Milling, Lathe, Assembly, Packing.</text></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"only-narrow\" data-state=\"base\"><p class=\"tr-label\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-3)\">Routing · projected utilisation and queue</p><ol class=\"vflow\"><li class=\"vstage\"><span class=\"vstage__name\">Milling</span><span class=\"vstage__u\" data-v-base=\"62%\" data-v-scenario=\"62%\">62%</span><span class=\"vstage__bar\"><i style=\"width:62%\" data-w-base=\"62\" data-w-scenario=\"62\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__q\"><span class=\"vstage__units\"><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"1\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__ql\">queue <b data-v-base=\"0.5 d\" data-v-scenario=\"0.5 d\">0.5 d</b></span></span></li><li class=\"vstage\"><span class=\"vstage__name\">Lathe</span><span class=\"vstage__u\" data-v-base=\"74%\" data-v-scenario=\"74%\">74%</span><span class=\"vstage__bar\"><i style=\"width:74%\" data-w-base=\"74\" data-w-scenario=\"74\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__q\"><span class=\"vstage__units\"><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"1\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"1\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"1\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__ql\">queue <b data-v-base=\"1.1 d\" data-v-scenario=\"1.0 d\">1.1 d</b></span></span></li><li class=\"vstage\" data-con=\"true\"><span class=\"vstage__name\">Assembly</span><span class=\"vstage__u\" data-v-base=\"91%\" data-v-scenario=\"80%\">91%</span><span class=\"vstage__bar\"><i style=\"width:91%\" data-w-base=\"91\" data-w-scenario=\"80\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__q\"><span class=\"vstage__units\"><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"1\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"1\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"0\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"0\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"0\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"0\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__ql\">queue <b data-v-base=\"3.2 d\" data-v-scenario=\"0.9 d\">3.2 d</b></span></span></li><li class=\"vstage\"><span class=\"vstage__name\">Packing</span><span class=\"vstage__u\" data-v-base=\"58%\" data-v-scenario=\"58%\">58%</span><span class=\"vstage__bar\"><i style=\"width:58%\" data-w-base=\"58\" data-w-scenario=\"58\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__q\"><span class=\"vstage__units\"><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"1\"></i><i style=\"opacity:1\" data-u-base=\"1\" data-u-scenario=\"0\"></i></span><span class=\"vstage__ql\">queue <b data-v-base=\"1.4 d\" data-v-scenario=\"0.5 d\">1.4 d</b></span></span></li></ol><p class=\"tr-label\" style=\"margin:var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-3)\">Lead time by operation</p><div class=\"mct\"><div class=\"mct__row\"><span class=\"mct__name\">Milling</span><span class=\"mct__bar\" style=\"--pb:3.6;--wb:6.0;--ps:3.6;--ws:6.0\"><i class=\"mct__p\"></i><i class=\"mct__w\"></i></span></div><div class=\"mct__row\"><span class=\"mct__name\">Lathe</span><span class=\"mct__bar\" style=\"--pb:7.1;--wb:13.1;--ps:7.1;--ws:11.9\"><i class=\"mct__p\"></i><i class=\"mct__w\"></i></span></div><div class=\"mct__row mct__row--con\"><span class=\"mct__name\">Assembly</span><span class=\"mct__bar\" style=\"--pb:10.7;--wb:38.1;--ps:10.7;--ws:10.7\"><i class=\"mct__p\"></i><i class=\"mct__w\"></i></span></div><div class=\"mct__row\"><span class=\"mct__name\">Packing</span><span class=\"mct__bar\" style=\"--pb:4.8;--wb:16.7;--ps:4.8;--ws:6.0\"><i class=\"mct__p\"></i><i class=\"mct__w\"></i></span></div></div><div class=\"mct__key\"><span><i class=\"k-p\"></i>Processing</span><span><i class=\"k-w\"></i>Waiting</span><span><i class=\"k-q\"></i>Waiting at Assembly</span></div></div>\n\n      <p class=\"vh\" role=\"status\" data-scene-live\n         data-msg-base=\"Current model. Assembly at 91 per cent utilisation, 3.2 days of queue, 8.4 days lead time.\"\n         data-msg-scenario=\"Scenario. Part of the Assembly load moves to a second qualified line. Assembly at 80 per cent, 0.9 days of queue, 5.1 days lead time.\"></p>\n\n      <div class=\"metrics u-mt10\" style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle);padding-top:var(--space-8)\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"metric__v\" data-on-scenario data-v-base=\"8.4\" data-v-scenario=\"5.1\">8.4</div>\n          <div class=\"metric__l\">days lead time</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"metric__v\" data-on-scenario data-v-base=\"1,240\" data-v-scenario=\"750\">1,240</div>\n          <div class=\"metric__l\">units of work in process</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"metric__v\" data-v-base=\"2.2\" data-v-scenario=\"2.2\">2.2</div>\n          <div class=\"metric__l\">days of that spent processing — unchanged</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"body u-mt8\" style=\"max-width:62ch\">Moving part of the Assembly load to a line the\n        routing can already reach takes Assembly from 91% to 80%. Processing time does not change at\n        all — every day saved is a day of waiting removed.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--ruled\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"max-width:52ch\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">From factory data to a decision.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead u-mt6\">Every screen answers three questions in the same order: what is\n        happening, why, and what to do about it.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"u-mt10 reveal\"><div data-tabs><div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Trooba Flow capabilities\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-overview\" data-tab-btn=\"overview\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"panel-overview\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"tabs__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.25\"/><path d=\"M12 12 L17 8\"/></svg></span><span class=\"tabs__lbl\">Overview</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-radar\" data-tab-btn=\"radar\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-radar\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"tabs__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3.5 L19.5 8 v8 L12 20.5 4.5 16 V8 Z\"/><path d=\"M12 3.5 V12 L19.5 8\"/><path d=\"M12 12 L4.5 8\"/><path d=\"M12 12 V20.5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"tabs__lbl\">Bottleneck Radar</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-whatif\" data-tab-btn=\"whatif\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-whatif\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"tabs__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3.5 12 H8 L10.5 6.5 13.5 17.5 16 12 H20.5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"tabs__lbl\">What-if Studio</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-flow\" data-tab-btn=\"flow\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-flow\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"tabs__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12 H7 L10 5.5 14 18.5 17 12 H21\"/><path d=\"M3 12 H21\" opacity=\".35\"/></svg></span><span class=\"tabs__lbl\">Flow &amp; Queue</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-capacity\" data-tab-btn=\"capacity\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-capacity\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"tabs__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 8 H16\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M4 12 H13\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M4 16 H18\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg></span><span class=\"tabs__lbl\">Capacity</span></button></div><div class=\"tabs__body\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-overview\" data-tab-panel=\"overview\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-overview\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"app\"><div class=\"app__bar\"><img src=\"/assets/logo/trooba-flow-light.svg\" alt=\"Trooba Flow\" width=\"311\" height=\"54\"><span class=\"app__crumb\"><b>Overview</b></span><span class=\"app__stamp\">Illustrative model</span></div><div class=\"app__body\"><ul class=\"app__nav\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Trooba Flow sections\"><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Analysis</li><li aria-current=\"true\">Overview</li><li>Bottleneck Radar</li><li>What-if Studio</li><li>Flow &amp; Queue</li><li>Capacity</li><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Model</li><li>Routings</li><li>Resources</li><li>Demand</li></ul><div class=\"app__main\">\n      <p class=\"tr-label app__q\">What is happening</p>\n      <p class=\"app__finding\">Assembly is predicted to become the next constraint.</p>\n      <div class=\"app__vals\">\n        <div><div class=\"app__val app__val--on\">91%</div><div class=\"app__vall\">projected utilisation</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"app__val\">3.2 d</div><div class=\"app__vall\">projected queue</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"app__val\">8.4 d</div><div class=\"app__vall\">projected lead time</div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"app__sec\">\n        <p class=\"tr-label app__q\">Why</p>\n        <div class=\"driver\">\n          <p>Demand mix is shifting toward products that need more Assembly time.</p>\n          <div><div class=\"driver__bar driver__bar--on\"><i style=\"width:64%\"></i></div>\n               <span class=\"driver__pct\">64% of the increase</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"driver\">\n          <p>Work arrives from Lathe in large transfer lots, in bursts rather than steadily.</p>\n          <div><div class=\"driver__bar\"><i style=\"width:26%\"></i></div>\n               <span class=\"driver__pct\">26% of the increase</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"meta u-mt6\">Projected queue at Assembly. The dashed line is the current average.</p>\n        <svg class=\"dg only-wide\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 128\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"qc-tonly-wide\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-5)\"><title id=\"qc-tonly-wide\">Projected queue time at Assembly rises to 3.2 days over the next ten days, against a current average of about 1.1 days.</title><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"40\" y1=\"59.8\" x2=\"552\" y2=\"59.8\"/><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"40\" y1=\"85.9\" x2=\"552\" y2=\"85.9\"/><line class=\"axis\" x1=\"40\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"552\" y2=\"112\"/><path class=\"series--ctx\" d=\"M40 83.3 H552\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><path class=\"series\" d=\"M40.0 88.5 L96.9 85.9 L153.8 80.7 L210.7 72.8 L267.6 57.2 L324.4 28.4 L381.3 33.7 L438.2 44.1 L495.1 54.6 L552.0 62.4\"/><circle cx=\"324.4\" cy=\"28.4\" r=\"3.5\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-primary)\"/><text class=\"dg-value dg-accent\" x=\"324.4\" y=\"16.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3.2 d</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"37.7\">3 d</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"89.9\">1 d</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"40\" y=\"126\">now</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"552\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\">+10 days</text></svg><svg class=\"dg only-narrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 128\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"qc-tonly-narrow\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-5)\"><title id=\"qc-tonly-narrow\">Projected queue time at Assembly rises to 3.2 days over the next ten days, against a current average of about 1.1 days.</title><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"40\" y1=\"59.8\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"59.8\"/><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"40\" y1=\"85.9\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"85.9\"/><line class=\"axis\" x1=\"40\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"112\"/><path class=\"series--ctx\" d=\"M40 83.3 H332\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><path class=\"series\" d=\"M40.0 88.5 L72.4 85.9 L104.9 80.7 L137.3 72.8 L169.8 57.2 L202.2 28.4 L234.7 33.7 L267.1 44.1 L299.6 54.6 L332.0 62.4\"/><circle cx=\"202.2\" cy=\"28.4\" r=\"3.5\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-primary)\"/><text class=\"dg-value dg-accent\" x=\"202.2\" y=\"16.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3.2 d</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"37.7\">3 d</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"89.9\">1 d</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"40\" y=\"126\">now</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"332\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\">+10 days</text></svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"app__sec\">\n        <p class=\"tr-label app__q\">What to do</p>\n        <div class=\"rec\">\n          <p class=\"rec__act\">Move part of the Assembly load to a second qualified line.</p>\n          <div class=\"rec__row\">\n            <div><div class=\"rec__d\">91% &rarr; 80%</div><div class=\"rec__dl\">projected utilisation at Assembly</div></div>\n            <div><div class=\"rec__d\">&minus;39%</div><div class=\"rec__dl\">projected lead time</div></div>\n            <div><div class=\"rec__d\">&plusmn;0</div><div class=\"rec__dl\">added capacity</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"rec__foot\">\n            <button class=\"app__btn app__btn--p\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\">Open in What-if Studio</button>\n            <button class=\"app__btn app__btn--s\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\">Show the model</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-radar\" data-tab-panel=\"radar\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-radar\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden><div class=\"app\"><div class=\"app__bar\"><img src=\"/assets/logo/trooba-flow-light.svg\" alt=\"Trooba Flow\" width=\"311\" height=\"54\"><span class=\"app__crumb\"><b>Bottleneck Radar</b></span><span class=\"app__stamp\">Illustrative model</span></div><div class=\"app__body\"><ul class=\"app__nav\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Trooba Flow sections\"><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Analysis</li><li>Overview</li><li aria-current=\"true\">Bottleneck Radar</li><li>What-if Studio</li><li>Flow &amp; Queue</li><li>Capacity</li><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Model</li><li>Routings</li><li>Resources</li><li>Demand</li></ul><div class=\"app__main\">\n      <p class=\"tr-label app__q\">What is happening</p>\n      <p class=\"app__finding\">One resource crosses the review threshold in the next ten days.</p>\n      <p class=\"body u-mt5\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-sm)\">Ranked on projected queue behaviour, not on\n        utilisation alone. A resource at 81% with steady arrivals can run calmer than one at 74%\n        receiving work in bursts.</p>\n      <div class=\"tbl-scroll tbl-scroll--radar u-mt6\"><table class=\"tbl tbl--radar\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Resource</th><th>Projected utilisation</th><th>Projected queue</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody><tr data-sel=\"true\"><td><span class=\"dot dot--on\"></span>Assembly</td><td class=\"v\">91%</td><td class=\"v\">3.2 d</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dot dot--warn\"></span>Lathe &middot; Line 2</td><td class=\"v\">81%</td><td class=\"v\">0.8 d</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dot dot--ctx\"></span>Lathe &middot; Line 1</td><td class=\"v\">74%</td><td class=\"v\">0.6 d</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dot dot--ctx\"></span>Milling</td><td class=\"v\">62%</td><td class=\"v\">0.3 d</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dot dot--ctx\"></span>Packing</td><td class=\"v\">58%</td><td class=\"v\">0.2 d</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dot dot--ctx\"></span>Slitting</td><td class=\"v\">41%</td><td class=\"v\">0.1 d</td></tr></tbody>\n      </table></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-whatif\" data-tab-panel=\"whatif\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-whatif\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden><div class=\"app\"><div class=\"app__bar\"><img src=\"/assets/logo/trooba-flow-light.svg\" alt=\"Trooba Flow\" width=\"311\" height=\"54\"><span class=\"app__crumb\"><b>What-if Studio</b></span><span class=\"app__stamp\">Illustrative model</span></div><div class=\"app__body\"><ul class=\"app__nav\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Trooba Flow sections\"><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Analysis</li><li>Overview</li><li>Bottleneck Radar</li><li aria-current=\"true\">What-if Studio</li><li>Flow &amp; Queue</li><li>Capacity</li><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Model</li><li>Routings</li><li>Resources</li><li>Demand</li></ul><div class=\"app__main\">\n      <p class=\"tr-label app__q\">What is happening</p>\n      <p class=\"app__finding\">The change that costs nothing is the largest one.</p>\n      <p class=\"body u-mt5\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-sm)\">Three scenarios against the same model.\n        Moving part of the load to a line the routing can already reach takes Assembly from 91% to\n        80% utilisation &mdash; and buys more lead time than paying for a second shift.</p>\n      <div class=\"scen-list u-mt6\" aria-label=\"Scenarios\">\n        <article class=\"scen\" data-tone=\"teal\">\n          <div class=\"scen__head\">\n            <span class=\"scen__n\">01</span>\n            <p class=\"scen__title\">Add a shift at Assembly</p>\n            <span class=\"scen__tag\">Adds cost</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"scen__metrics\">\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Lead time</span><span class=\"scen__v\">6.6 d</span></div>\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Change</span><span class=\"scen__v scen__v--pos\">&minus;21%</span></div>\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Trade-off</span><span class=\"scen__v scen__v--plain\">Adds cost</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"scen\" data-tone=\"warn\">\n          <div class=\"scen__head\">\n            <span class=\"scen__n\">02</span>\n            <p class=\"scen__title\">Halve the transfer lot at Lathe</p>\n            <span class=\"scen__tag\">Adds setups</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"scen__metrics\">\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Lead time</span><span class=\"scen__v\">5.9 d</span></div>\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Change</span><span class=\"scen__v scen__v--pos\">&minus;30%</span></div>\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Trade-off</span><span class=\"scen__v scen__v--plain\">Adds setups</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"scen scen--sel\" data-tone=\"teal\" data-sel=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"scen__head\">\n            <span class=\"scen__n\">03</span>\n            <p class=\"scen__title\">Move part of the load to a second line</p>\n            <span class=\"scen__tag\">No added capacity</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"scen__metrics\">\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Lead time</span><span class=\"scen__v\">5.1 d</span></div>\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Change</span><span class=\"scen__v scen__v--pos\">&minus;39%</span></div>\n            <div><span class=\"scen__k\">Trade-off</span><span class=\"scen__v scen__v--plain\">No added<br>capacity</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tbl-scroll tbl-scroll--desk u-mt6\"><table class=\"tbl\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Lead time</th><th>Change</th><th>Trade-off</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody><tr><td><span class=\"v u-tert\">01</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Add a shift at Assembly</td><td class=\"v\">6.6 d</td><td class=\"v u-accent\">&minus;21%</td><td class=\"u-tert\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-meta)\">Adds cost</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"v u-tert\">02</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Halve the transfer lot at Lathe</td><td class=\"v\">5.9 d</td><td class=\"v u-accent\">&minus;30%</td><td class=\"u-tert\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-meta)\">Adds setups</td></tr><tr data-sel=\"true\"><td><span class=\"v u-tert\">03</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Move part of the load to a second line</td><td class=\"v\">5.1 d</td><td class=\"v u-accent\">&minus;39%</td><td class=\"u-tert\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-meta)\">No added capacity</td></tr></tbody>\n      </table></div>\n      <p class=\"meta u-mt5\">Current model: 8.4 days. Illustrative.</p></div></div></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-flow\" data-tab-panel=\"flow\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-flow\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden><div class=\"app\"><div class=\"app__bar\"><img src=\"/assets/logo/trooba-flow-light.svg\" alt=\"Trooba Flow\" width=\"311\" height=\"54\"><span class=\"app__crumb\"><b>Flow &amp; Queue</b></span><span class=\"app__stamp\">Illustrative model</span></div><div class=\"app__body\"><ul class=\"app__nav\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Trooba Flow sections\"><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Analysis</li><li>Overview</li><li>Bottleneck Radar</li><li>What-if Studio</li><li aria-current=\"true\">Flow &amp; Queue</li><li>Capacity</li><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Model</li><li>Routings</li><li>Resources</li><li>Demand</li></ul><div class=\"app__main\">\n      <p class=\"tr-label app__q\">What is happening</p>\n      <p class=\"app__finding\">Three quarters of lead time is waiting, not work.</p>\n      <p class=\"body u-mt5\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-sm)\">Lead time is decomposed operation by\n        operation into processing, waiting and batching &mdash; so the argument is about where the\n        time goes, not whether it is there.</p>\n      <div class=\"u-mt6\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 176\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"lt-tab-t\"><title id=\"lt-tab-t\">Of 8.4 days of lead time, 2.2 days is processing, 3.2 days is waiting at Assembly and 3.0 days is waiting elsewhere. Illustrative.</title><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"14\">Where the 8.4 days actually goes</text><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"104.8\" height=\"26\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-1)\"/><line x1=\"104.8\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"104.8\" y2=\"54\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface-primary);stroke-width:2\"/><rect x=\"104.8\" y=\"28\" width=\"152.4\" height=\"26\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-primary)\"/><line x1=\"257.1\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"257.1\" y2=\"54\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface-primary);stroke-width:2\"/><rect x=\"257.1\" y=\"28\" width=\"142.9\" height=\"26\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-3)\"/><line x1=\"400.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"400.0\" y2=\"54\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface-primary);stroke-width:2\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"76\" width=\"14\" height=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-1)\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"24\" y=\"84\">Processing</text><text class=\"dg-value\" x=\"420\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"end\">2.2 d</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"110\" width=\"14\" height=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-primary)\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"24\" y=\"118\">Waiting at Assembly</text><text class=\"dg-value dg-accent\" x=\"420\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.2 d</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"144\" width=\"14\" height=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-3)\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"24\" y=\"152\">Waiting elsewhere</text><text class=\"dg-value\" x=\"420\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.0 d</text></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-capacity\" data-tab-panel=\"capacity\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-capacity\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden><div class=\"app\"><div class=\"app__bar\"><img src=\"/assets/logo/trooba-flow-light.svg\" alt=\"Trooba Flow\" width=\"311\" height=\"54\"><span class=\"app__crumb\"><b>Capacity</b></span><span class=\"app__stamp\">Illustrative model</span></div><div class=\"app__body\"><ul class=\"app__nav\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Trooba Flow sections\"><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Analysis</li><li>Overview</li><li>Bottleneck Radar</li><li>What-if Studio</li><li>Flow &amp; Queue</li><li aria-current=\"true\">Capacity</li><li class=\"tr-label app__navlabel\" role=\"presentation\">Model</li><li>Routings</li><li>Resources</li><li>Demand</li></ul><div class=\"app__main\">\n      <p class=\"tr-label app__q\">What is happening</p>\n      <p class=\"app__finding\">One line has capacity the routing can reach and is not using.</p>\n      <p class=\"body u-mt5\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-sm)\">Before capital goes into a machine, the\n        model shows what is already available and what would have to change &mdash; a routing, a\n        qualification, a setup &mdash; to reach it.</p>\n      <div class=\"u-mt6\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 176\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"cap-tab-t\"><title id=\"cap-tab-t\">Four assembly lines. Line 3 has 34 per cent of capacity that the current routing can reach but does not use. Illustrative.</title><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"14\">Assembly lines · committed vs available</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"44\">Line 1</text><rect x=\"72\" y=\"34\" width=\"272\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-3)\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"34\" width=\"239.4\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-1)\"/><text class=\"dg-value\" x=\"420\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"end\">88%</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"78\">Line 2</text><rect x=\"72\" y=\"68\" width=\"272\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-3)\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"68\" width=\"201.3\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-1)\"/><text class=\"dg-value\" x=\"420\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">74%</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"112\">Line 3</text><rect x=\"72\" y=\"102\" width=\"272\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-3)\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"102\" width=\"97.9\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-1)\"/><rect x=\"169.9\" y=\"102\" width=\"92.5\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-primary)\"/><text class=\"dg-value dg-accent\" x=\"420\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"end\">+34%</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"146\">Line 4</text><rect x=\"72\" y=\"136\" width=\"272\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-3)\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"136\" width=\"141.4\" height=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--chart-neutral-1)\"/><text class=\"dg-value\" x=\"420\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\">52%</text></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n    <p class=\"fig__note fig__note--rule\">Trooba Flow. Figures throughout are from an illustrative\n      model, not a customer result.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--ruled\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title reveal\">Measured in a real factory.</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"u-mt10 reveal\">\n      <p class=\"result__v\">28 <span>&rarr;</span> <em>7</em> days</p>\n      <p class=\"result__cap u-mt5\"><span class=\"u-mono u-accent\">&gt;75%</span> reduction in\n        manufacturing lead time · same factory, same machines</p>\n      <p class=\"lead u-mt8\" style=\"max-width:50ch\">The constraint was not machine speed. It was lot\n        sizing and queue dynamics — the way work was moving through the system.</p>\n      <p class=\"body u-mt6\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-sm)\">Tarinika · jewellery manufacturer ·\n        multi-SKU, make-to-order.<br><span class=\"u-tert\">Tarinika is the founder&rsquo;s\n        manufacturing company.</span></p>\n      <p class=\"u-mt8\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/proof\">Read the case study <span class=\"arw\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a></p>\n      <p class=\"meta u-mt10\" style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle);padding-top:var(--space-6);max-width:56ch\">\n        Trooba Flow is also being validated with a high-mix packaging manufacturer as a design\n        partner. Those results are modelled, and are labelled as modelled.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--ruled\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title reveal\">Model. Understand. Improve.</h2>\n    <div class=\"steps u-mt10\">\n      <div class=\"step reveal\">\n        <div class=\"row__idx\">01</div>\n        <div><h3>Model</h3>\n          <p class=\"body u-mt4\">Products, routings, resources, demand and variability.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"row__fig\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 180\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"hiw1-t\"><title id=\"hiw1-t\">A routing network: seven work centres connected by the paths products take through them.</title><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"86\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"60\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"86\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"60\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"86\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"130\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"86\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"130\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"216\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"60\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"216\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"130\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"216\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"130\"/><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"34\" y=\"27\" width=\"52\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"60\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mill</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"34\" y=\"87\" width=\"52\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"60\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lathe</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"34\" y=\"147\" width=\"52\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"60\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Slit</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"164\" y=\"47\" width=\"52\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"190\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Glue</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"164\" y=\"117\" width=\"52\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"190\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Assy</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"304\" y=\"47\" width=\"52\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"330\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pack</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"304\" y=\"117\" width=\"52\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"330\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">QC</text></svg></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\">\n        <div class=\"row__idx\">02</div>\n        <div><h3>Understand</h3>\n          <p class=\"body u-mt4\">See where queues, constraints and lead time emerge.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"row__fig\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 150\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"hiw2-t\"><title id=\"hiw2-t\">The same routing with work accumulating at the third operation, marked as the emerging constraint.</title><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"34\" y=\"76\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"90\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"96\"/><rect class=\"unit\" x=\"24\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"62\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Milling</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"134\" y=\"76\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"190\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"96\"/><rect class=\"unit\" x=\"124\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"162\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lathe</text><rect class=\"wc wc--con\" x=\"234\" y=\"76\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\"/><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"290\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"96\"/><rect class=\"unit--on\" x=\"224\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect class=\"unit--on\" x=\"212\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect class=\"unit--on\" x=\"200\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect class=\"unit--on\" x=\"188\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect class=\"unit--on\" x=\"176\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><rect class=\"unit--on\" x=\"164\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"262\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Assembly</text><rect class=\"wc\" x=\"334\" y=\"76\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\"/><rect class=\"unit\" x=\"324\" y=\"91\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"/><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"362\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Packing</text><line class=\"flow\" x1=\"184\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"184\" y2=\"44\" style=\"stroke:var(--action-primary)\"/><text class=\"dg-accent\" x=\"184\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"500\">Constraint emerging</text></svg></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\">\n        <div class=\"row__idx\">03</div>\n        <div><h3>Improve</h3>\n          <p class=\"body u-mt4\">Test changes before making them on the factory floor.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"row__fig\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 128\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"hiw3-t\"><title id=\"hiw3-t\">Current model at 8.4 days and 1,240 units against a scenario at 4.9 days and 760 units: 42 per cent less lead time, 39 per cent less work in process. Illustrative.</title><text class=\"dg-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"14\">Current</text><text class=\"dg-value-lg\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\">8.4</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"70\">days lead time</text><text class=\"dg-value\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\">1,240</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"0\" y=\"116\">units WIP</text><text class=\"dg-label\" x=\"168\" y=\"14\">Scenario</text><text class=\"dg-value-lg dg-accent\" x=\"168\" y=\"52\">5.1</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"168\" y=\"70\">days lead time</text><text class=\"dg-value dg-accent\" x=\"168\" y=\"98\">750</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"168\" y=\"116\">units WIP</text><path class=\"flow\" d=\"M136 44 h20\" style=\"stroke:var(--chart-neutral-1)\"/><text class=\"dg-label\" x=\"324\" y=\"14\">Impact</text><text class=\"dg-value-lg dg-accent\" x=\"324\" y=\"52\">−39%</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"324\" y=\"70\">lead time</text><text class=\"dg-value dg-accent\" x=\"324\" y=\"98\">−40%</text><text class=\"dg-micro\" x=\"324\" y=\"116\">WIP</text></svg></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"u-mt14 reveal\" style=\"max-width:56ch\">\n      <h3>Sophisticated underneath. Simple where it matters.</h3>\n      <p class=\"body u-mt4\">Trooba models how demand, variability, routing and resource loading\n        interact to create queues and lead time. AI explains the model. The mathematics grounds it.</p>\n      <p class=\"u-mt6\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/how-it-works\">See the methodology <span class=\"arw\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--ruled\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"max-width:52ch\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">See how work really flows through your factory.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead u-mt6\">Share a small set of factory data and see where queues, bottlenecks and\n        hidden capacity are affecting performance.</p>\n      <p class=\"u-mt10\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" data-primary-cta href=\"/flow-analysis\">Request a Flow Analysis</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>";
